<title>SWEDEN: No comment on Unibank talk - S-E-Banken.</title>
<headline>No comment on Unibank talk - S-E-Banken.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of Sweden's big four banks, S-E-Banken, on Tuesday declined to comment on rumours reported in the Swedish press that it was in merger talks with Denmark's second largest bank, Unidanmark.</p>
<p>&quot;We make no comment on market rumours,&quot; a bank spokeswoman told Reuters.</p>
<p>Business daily Dagens Industri reported on Tuesday that the two banks were in negotiations over a possible merger.</p>
<p>Unidanmark, which is mainly Unibank, denied the rumours.</p>
<p>&quot;There is no truth in these rumours,&quot; Unidanmark chief executive Thorleif Krarup told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
